[{"id":2492319133,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDI0OTIzMTkxMzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/events/2492319133","actor":{"login":"simonwalker-celadin","id":29273542,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MjczNTQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29273542?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simonwalker-celadin","html_url":"https://github.com/simonwalker-celadin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simonwalker-celadin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simonwalker-celadin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simonwalker-celadin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simonwalker-celadin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simonwalker-celadin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simonwalker-celadin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simonwalker-celadin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simonwalker-celadin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simonwalker-celadin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-07-18T10:54:49Z","label":{"name":"Bug","color":"ffffff"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/512969635","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react-native/issues/25708#issuecomment-512969635","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/25708","id":512969635,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUxMjk2OTYzNQ==","user":{"login":"RobinCsl","id":22741774,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQxNzc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22741774?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl","html_url":"https://github.com/RobinCsl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-07-18T20:12:38Z","updated_at":"2019-07-18T20:15:03Z","body":"Hi @simonwalker-celadin,\r\n\r\nI just succeeded to add custom fonts to my own project with React Native version 0.60.3, and my `react-native.config.js` file looks slightly different than yours:\r\n\r\n```\r\nmodule.exports = {\r\n  assets: ['./assets/fonts'],\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is what my file tree looks like:\r\n```\r\nApp.js\r\n__tests__\r\nandroid\r\napp.json\r\nassets/\r\n└── fonts\r\n    ├── CustomFont.otf\r\n    ├── CustomFont-Bold.otf\r\n    └── CustomFont-Medium.otf\r\nbabel.config.js\r\nindex.js\r\nios\r\nmetro.config.js\r\nnode_modules\r\npackage.json\r\nreact-native.config.js\r\nyarn.lock\r\n```\r\n\r\nRunning `react-native link` correctly detected the `fonts` folder inside my `assets` folder:\r\n```\r\ninfo Linking assets to ios project\r\nwarn Group 'Resources' does not exist in your Xcode project. We have created it automatically for you.\r\ninfo Linking assets to android project\r\nsuccess Assets have been successfully linked to your project\r\n✨  Done in 1.14s.\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nIt looks like you took inspiration from the Libraries section from the documentation of `react-native link`: https://github.com/react-native-community/cli/blob/master/docs/configuration.md#libraries\r\n\r\nFor an app, you don't need to scope your configuration under `dependency`.\r\n\r\nSo replace your config with\r\n```\r\nmodule.exports = {\r\n  project: {\r\n    ios: {},\r\n    android: {},\r\n  },\r\n  assets: ['./assets/fonts/'],\r\n};\r\n```\r\nand you should be good to go! (I believe you can also drop the `project` part and use essentially the same config file as I used for my project.)\r\n\r\nHope that helps!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/512969635/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":7,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"RobinCsl","id":22741774,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQxNzc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22741774?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl","html_url":"https://github.com/RobinCsl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobinCsl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2493895094,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MjQ5Mzg5NTA5NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/events/2493895094","actor":{"login":"simonwalker-celadin","id":29273542,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MjczNTQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29273542?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simonwalker-celadin","html_url":"