ive/issues/25708","id":555455078,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU1NTQ1NTA3OA==","user":{"login":"Macilias","id":883740,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4Mzc0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883740?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macilias","html_url":"https://github.com/Macilias","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macilias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macilias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macilias/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macilias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macilias/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macilias/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macilias/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macilias/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macilias/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-11-19T11:01:22Z","updated_at":"2019-11-19T11:47:15Z","body":"same here, although I declared the moule to use ONLY my custom extensions metro.config.js is clearly ignored. \r\n```\r\nmodule.exports = {\r\n  project: {\r\n    ios: {},\r\n    android: {},\r\n  },\r\n  assets: [\r\n    './src/assets/icons',\r\n    './src/assets/svg',\r\n    './src/assets/ai',\r\n  ],\r\n  assetExts: [\r\n    \".xml\", \".png\", \".jpg\", \".pb\", \".tflite\"\r\n  ]\r\n};\r\n```\r\nand the message is still the same:\r\n```\r\nerror: bundling failed: Error: Unable to resolve module `./ai/annotations/Part1.xml` from `...src/assets/default-assets.js`: The module `./ai/annotations/Part1.xml` could not be found from `.../src/assets/default-assets.js`. Indeed, none of these files exist:\r\n  * `.../src/assets/ai/annotations/Part1.xml(.native||.android.js|.native.js|.js|.android.json|.native.json|.json|.android.ts|.native.ts|.ts|.android.tsx|.native.tsx|.tsx)`\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt